# automatic translation
#: commands.docbook:243
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Put selected item(s) into the clipboard and remove them from the "
"original location.</action> If you then do a "
"<guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem> the item(s) will be inserted at the new "
"location."
msgstr ""
"<action>चयनितवस्तूनि (वस्तूनि) क्लिप्बोर्ड् मध्ये स्थापयित्वा मूलस्थानात् "
"निष्कासयन्तु।</action> यदि भवान् ततः <guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem> करोति "
"तर्हि द्रव्यं (वस्तूनि) नूतनस्थाने सम्मिलितं भविष्यति"

# automatic translation
#: commands.docbook:251
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>सम्पादन</guimenu> <guimenuitem>प्रतिलिपि</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: commands.docbook:258
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copy selected item(s) to the clipboard."
msgstr "चयनितं द्रव्यं (वस्तूनि) क्लिप्बोर्ड् प्रति प्रतिलिख्यताम् ।"

# automatic translation
#: commands.docbook:263
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>V</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Paste</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>V</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>सम्पादन</guimenu> <guimenuitem>चिपकतु</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: commands.docbook:270
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Paste item(s) from the clipboard to the selected cell(s)."
msgstr "क्लिप्बोर्डतः चयनितकोष्ठके (कोष्ठकेषु) द्रव्यं (वस्तूनि) चिनोतु ।"

# automatic translation
#: commands.docbook:276
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Special Paste...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सम्पादनं</guimenu> <guimenuitem>विशेष पेस्ट्...</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: commands.docbook:280 commands.docbook:1173
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Special forms of Paste. </action> See the sections <link "
"linkend=\"specialpaste\">Other Paste Modes</link> and <link "
"linkend=\"sumspecialpaste\">Arithmetic using Special Paste</link> for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"<action>पेस्ट के विशेष रूप।</action> खण्डान् पश्यन्तु<link "
"linkend=\"specialpaste\"> अन्ये पेस्ट मोड्स</link> तथा<link "
"linkend=\"sumspecialpaste\"> Special Paste इत्यस्य उपयोगेन गणितम्</link> "
"अधिकविवरणार्थम्।"

# automatic translation
#: commands.docbook:288
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Paste with Insertion</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सम्पादनं</guimenu> <guimenuitem>निवेशेन सह चिनोतु</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: commands.docbook:292
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Move content of the paste area either to the right or down and paste "
"item(s) from the clipboard to the selected cell(s)."
msgstr ""
"पेस्ट् क्षेत्रस्य सामग्रीं दक्षिणतः अधः वा स्थानान्तरयन्तु तथा च "
"क्लिप्बोर्डतः चयनितकोष्ठकं (कोष्ठकेषु) द्रव्यं (वस्तूनि) चिनोतु ।"

# automatic translation
#: commands.docbook:298
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Fill</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सम्पादनं</guimenu> <guisubmenu>पूरणं</guisubmenu>"

# automatic translation
#: commands.docbook:302
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Fills up the selected area with the values from the first "
"item-set.</action> All four directions are supported. Note that the term "
"\"item-set\" describes the first set of values seen in the fill direction. "
"If the fill direction is Left then the first item-set is the last column of "
"the selection."
msgstr ""
"<action>प्रथम-वस्तु-समूहात् मूल्यैः चयनितं क्षेत्रं पूरयति ।</action> "
"चत्वारि अपि दिशः समर्थिताः सन्ति । ध्यानं कुर्वन्तु यत् \"item-set\" इति "
"पदं पूरणदिशि दृष्टस्य मूल्यसमूहस्य प्रथमसमूहस्य वर्णनं करोति । यदि पूरणदिशा "
